38:46.240 --> 38:49.240
The pouch was okay.

38:49.240 --> 38:54.240
It would have been nice to have a little dispenser that was easier to use than the pouch.

38:54.240 --> 38:56.240
I don't know whether that would be possible to do or not.

38:56.240 --> 39:01.240
It seems to me it would a little tube dispenser of some kind where they came out more easily.

39:01.240 --> 39:04.240
You didn't tend to.

39:04.240 --> 39:09.240
We generally just cut the corner off the pouch and squeezed them out but it was little inconvenient.

39:09.240 --> 39:11.240
No, nothing major.

